      "content": "[tool_semantics]\nOnly action kinds listed in [action_schema] are callable. Disabled tools are invalid before dispatch. query_memory, inspect_checks, and run_check are kernel-owned affordances when present in action_schema. Actions may include optional target metadata for automatic memory matching; target is advisory metadata, not a required tool argument.",
